  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "skill-n",
      "ability-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Ability** is the power to do something, which you may have by nature or by learning (*the ability to swim*, *a natural ability in music*). **Skill** is an ability that comes from training and practice, and it is the usual word for things you learn for work or study (*computer skills*, *the skill of a good doctor*)."
  },
